::  name       layout channel ceiling gate
::  shape      channel - int (@u32) -> lawful - int (@u32)
::  invariant  answers 1 while the input channel stays at or under 255; answers 0 past the ceiling
::  law        brushstroke/skate_cell_grid.rye 8-bit palette per channel
::  example    128 -> 1 - 256 -> 0
::  readers    Brushstroke - Skate - Glow layout
::  nib        glow-language journey Orbit 10 -- layout shapes (20261104)
::
::  Skate's cell grid paints each cell with an 8-bit color per channel.
::  Red, green, and blue each stay at or under 255. This gate is that
::  ceiling made runnable in Glow; the witness validates all three
::  channels of layout-color through the same desk.
|=  sample=@u32
?:  (gth sample 255)  0  1
